Package: luci-app-envisalink
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: egite <139096069+egite@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: luci
Priority: optional
Depends: luci-base, tpi-proxy
Description: LuCI interface for the EnvisaLink TPI proxy
 Adds Services -> Envisalink to configure the TPI proxy, see whether it is
 running, and start / stop / restart it. Installing this pulls in the proxy
 (tpi-proxy) and its python3 dependencies automatically.
